<p>

```javascript
const HEX_PREFIX = "#";
const HEX_RADIX = 16;
const HEX_LENGTH = 6;

function generateRandomHex() {
  return (
    HEX_PREFIX +
    Math.floor(Math.random() * 0xffffff)
      .toString(HEX_RADIX)
      .padStart(HEX_LENGTH, "0")
  );
}
```

