### Real Coding Task: Write a JavaScript program to implement the bubble sort algorithm for sorting an array of numbers.

**Role**: Java Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Write a JavaScript program to implement the bubble sort algorithm for sorting an array of numbers.
**Input Specification**:
```
[4, 2, 7, 1, 6, 5]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
function bubbleSort(arr) {
  let temp;
  let swapped;
  for (let i = 0; i < arr.length; i++) {
    swapped = false;
    for (let j = 0; j < arr.length - 1; j++) {
      if (arr[j] > arr[j + 1]) {
        temp = arr[j];
        arr[j] = arr[j + 1];
        arr[j + 1] = temp;
        swapped = true;
      }
    }
    if (!swapped) break;
  }
  return arr;
}
```

