### Real Coding Task: Write a C++ program to print a pyramid of asterisks with a given height.

**Role**: Full Stack Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Easy

#### Problem Description
Write a C++ program to print a pyramid of asterisks with a given height.
**Input Specification**:
```
height = 5
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
void print_pyramid(int height) {
  for (int i = 0; i < height; i++) {
    for (int j = 0; j < height - i - 1; j++)
      cout << " ";
    for (int k = 0; k <= i; k++)
      cout << "* ";
    cout << endl;
  }
}
```

